{"resource":{"id":"react-best-practices","title":"React.js — Best Practices","category":"Web Development","difficulty":"Intermediate","readingTime":"14 min","pages":23,"lastUpdated":"February 2026","tags":["Web Development","React","Hooks"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"React coding standards, component architecture, hooks best practices, Context, performance, testing, a11y, security, folder org, deployment, docs."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"intro","label":"Introduction"},{"id":"design","label":"Component Design Principles"},{"id":"hooks","label":"Custom Hooks"},{"id":"perf","label":"Performance Optimization"},{"id":"a11y","label":"Accessibility"},{"id":"security","label":"Security"},{"id":"folder","label":"Folder Structure"},{"id":"testing","label":"Testing"},{"id":"deploy","label":"Deployment"},{"id":"code","label":"Custom Hook Pattern"},{"id":"table","label":"Do / Don't Table"},{"id":"checklist","label":"Production Checklist"},{"id":"mistakes","label":"Common Mistakes"},{"id":"tips","label":"Tips & Tricks"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary & Key Takeaways"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQs"},{"id":"refs","label":"Further Reading & References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"React.js — Complete Tutorial","tag":"Web Development","time":"45 min"},{"title":"React.js — Cheat Sheet","tag":"Web Development","time":"5 min"},{"title":"React.js — Interview Questions","tag":"Web Development","time":"34 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Adopt the practices that separate hobby code from production code.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"intro\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Introduction</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Best practices are patterns that survived contact with real users, real teams, and real incidents.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"design\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Component Design Principles</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Small. Single-purpose. Composable. Data-in, JSX-out. Prefer composition over configuration. Props &lt; 5, else split.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — Overview diagram for component design principles.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"hooks\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Custom Hooks</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Extract when logic repeats twice. Name with 'use' prefix. Return stable references. Test them in isolation.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"perf\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Performance Optimization</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Measure before optimizing. Memoize expensive computations, not everything. Virtualize long lists. Split code by route.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"a11y\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Accessibility</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Semantic HTML first. Test with keyboard only. Announce dynamic changes with aria-live. Trap focus in modals.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"security\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Security</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Never dangerouslySetInnerHTML unstrusted content. Sanitize with DOMPurify. CSP headers. httpOnly cookies for tokens.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"folder\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Folder Structure</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Feature-first. Colocate tests + stories + styles. Barrel files at feature root only.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"testing\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Testing</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Testing Library queries by role. Integration &gt; unit for UI. Playwright for critical E2E. 80% branch coverage.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 — Reference visual for testing.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"deploy\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Deployment</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Immutable builds. Preview per PR. Feature flags. Progressive rollout. Instant rollback.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"code\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Custom Hook Pattern</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>import { useState, useEffect } from &quot;react&quot;;\n\nexport function useDebounced&lt;T&gt;(value: T, ms = 300) {\n  const [v, setV] = useState(value);\n  useEffect(() =&gt; {\n    const id = setTimeout(() =&gt; setV(value), ms);\n    return () =&gt; clearTimeout(id);\n  }, [value, ms]);\n  return v;\n}</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"table\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Do / Don&#x27;t Table</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Concept</th><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">When to use</th><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Trade-off</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">useState</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Local UI state</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Not for shared state</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">useReducer</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Complex transitions</td><td class=\"border p-2\">More boilerplate</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">Context</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Cross-cutting concerns</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Re-renders consumers</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">React Query</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Server state</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Extra dep</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"checklist\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Production Checklist</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Lint green. Types green. Tests green. Lighthouse ≥90. A11y audit clean. Bundle under budget. Monitoring live.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"mistakes\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Common Mistakes</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Premature abstraction. God components. useEffect for derived state. Missing error boundaries.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"tips\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Tips &amp; Tricks</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Prettier + ESLint + strict TS. Pre-commit hooks. CODEOWNERS. RFC template for changes over 200 LOC.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Boring code, exciting product. Best practices exist to keep the boring parts boring.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQs</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>How do I get started?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Read the sections in order, then apply immediately to a project.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Is this current for React 19?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Yes — content reflects React 19 and the Compiler.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Where can I ask questions?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Open an issue in the EduNova AI community or ask the in-app AI tutor.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"refs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Further Reading &amp; References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Guidance, not gospel. Adapt to your team.</p>\n      </div></section>"}